# Local model comparison artifacts. Only the build the app actually loads is
# committed; these exist to compare conversions side by side and would put
# ~13 MB of near-duplicate binaries into history forever. The untouched
# Sketchfab download lives outside the repo, in 3d-models-glb/Exports/.
public/models/dino-001.glb
public/models/dino-001-basecolor.glb
public/models/dino-001-metalrough.glb

